<blockquote>
<div>The time at which the elastic inference accelerator is associated with an instance.</div></blockquote>
</div></blockquote>
</div></blockquote>
<p>NetworkInterfaces -&gt; (list)</p>
<blockquote>
<div><p>The network interfaces for the instance.</p>
<p>(structure)</p>
<blockquote>
<div><p>Describes a network interface.</p>
