<p>Possible values:</p>
<ul class="simple">
<li><code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">devpay</span></code></li>
<li><code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">marketplace</span></code></li>
</ul>
</div></blockquote>
</div></blockquote>
</div></blockquote>
